      <title>编程界的“长跑者”Anders Hejlsberg：当IDE让位给Agent，人类正从代码写作者变为“审核员”</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/anders-hejlsbergideagent-20260206164005867-1/</link>
